<title>UK: Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on DTB-Bund-Future.</title>
<headline>Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on DTB-Bund-Future.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp says it has issued 60 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the DTB-Bund-Future March 1997.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 02.SEP.96-06.MAR.97   PAYDATE	30.AUG.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  95.35 PCT</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  96.00 PCT   1.16 DEM	 1.90 PCT	82.20 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  97.00 PCT   0.75 DEM	 2.50 PCT     127.10 X</p>
<p> CALL C	  98.00 PCT   0.47 DEM	 3.30 PCT     202.90 X</p>
<p> PUT D	   94.00 PCT   0.94 DEM	 2.40 PCT     101.40 X</p>
<p> PUT E	   95.0 PCT    1.33 DEM	 1.80 PCT	71.70 X</p>
<p> PUT F	   96.0 PCT    1.84 DEM	 1.20 PCT	51.80 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
